source: crates/hydronode-cli/tests/c3_help.rs
expression: text
---
Print a completion script for your shell.

Usage: hn completion [OPTIONS] <SHELL>

Arguments:
  <SHELL>  Shell [possible values: bash, elvish, fish, powershell, zsh]

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
  -p, --profile <NAME>  Profile to use (server and login), see 'hn profile list'
      --json            Print JSON instead of tables (stable shape, for scripts)

Examples:
  hn completion zsh > "${fpath[1]}/_hn"
  hn completion bash > ~/.local/share/bash-completion/completions/hn
  hn completion fish > ~/.config/fish/completions/hn.fish
